1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,218
Take two identical cylinders, each with one mole of gas.

2
00:00:04,218 --> 00:00:06,731
On the left, the piston is clamped.

3
00:00:06,731 --> 00:00:09,114
On the right, it is free to move.

4
00:00:09,114 --> 00:00:11,914
Give both exactly the same amount of heat.

